# --- Test Hub's own runtime data -----------------------------------------
# `test-hub serve` normally writes to the platform data dir, but pointing
# TEST_HUB_DATA_DIR at the checkout is the usual way to debug, so keep the
# database, the artifact tree and exported snapshots out of commits.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
test-hub.db*
artifacts/
test-hub-report.html
test-hub-export*.html

# --- Editors & OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Documentation site ---------------------------------------------------
# site/docs/ is the BUILT site and IS committed — GitHub Pages serves it
# straight from the repository. Nothing under site/ is ignored on purpose.
